SUMMARY:Form 1065 and Form 1120-S due for calendar-year 2026
DESCRIPTION:File the return or Form 7004 for a six-month extension. Late 
 penalty for returns due in 2027: $260 per partner or shareholder per mont
 h\, up to 12 months.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/business-t
 ax-return-deadline-late/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Merchant 
 Financial Advisory\, mfa-advisory.com
