SUMMARY:NY: Form CT-3-S due (calendar-year S corporations)
DESCRIPTION:File within 2½ months after the year ends\, or request six m
 ore months with Form CT-5.4 and pay the estimated tax.\n\nDetails: https:
 //mfa-advisory.com/blog/business-tax-return-deadline-late/\nGeneral infor
 mation\, not tax advice. Merchant Financial Advisory\, mfa-advisory.com
URL:https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/business-tax-return-deadline-late/
