DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
SUMMARY:Form 1120 due for calendar-year 2026 C corporations
DESCRIPTION:Form 7004 gives six more months to file\, not to pay. Minimum
  late-filing penalty for returns due in 2027: the smaller of $535 or the 
 tax due.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/business-tax-return-de
 adline-late/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Merchant Financial Ad
 visory\, mfa-advisory.com
